"{\"texts\":[{\"i\":0,\"tag\":\"DIV\",\"text\":\"Try Riley risk free with our 7-day free trial!\"},{\"i\":1,\"tag\":\"DIV\",\"text\":\"Blog\\nWhat's New?\\nGet Started For Free\\nPanic Scrolling Stops Here. Meet\\nRiley.\\n\\nGet instant, pediatrician-backed parenting support the moment you need it. Riley has award-winning, 24/7 advice tailored to your family with smart tracking and guidance. Parent confidently, with the only parenting app you'll ever need.\\n\\nGet Started For Free\\n\\nAvailable on:\"},{\"i\":2,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"Parenting isn't one-size-fits-all.\\nYour support shouldn't be, either.\\nRiley learns and remembers what matters: your baby's growth stage, tracking logs, and past wins to give guidance that fits your family.\\nSupport that thinks, adapts, and grows with you.\"},{\"i\":3,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"What Parenting Superpower Do You Need Today?\\nSurvive the newborn stage\\nGet help with naps and sleep\\nSupport baby development\\nNavigating toddler tantrums\\nStarting solid foods\\nBuild a routine\"},{\"i\":4,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"Here's How Real Users\\nTalk to Riley:\\nTalk to Riley\"},{\"i\":5,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"Our Clinical Advisory Board\\nDesigned with Experts, for Real Families\\n\\nOur Clinical Advisory Board includes pediatricians, therapists, and specialists, who help us keep Riley grounded in real, evidence-based support.\\n\\nDr. Lilly Jay\\n\\nPsyD, PMH-C, Perinatal Health\\n\\nDr. Kate Roche\\n\\nMD, Child Neurology\"},{\"i\":6,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"How Riley Works\\nBuilt on science\\nthat matters\\n\\nWhen answering your questions, Riley draws from the latest child development research, expert-reviewed sources that are vetted by our Clinical Advisory Board.\\n\\nPowered by tech that learns\\nand grows with you\\n\\nOnce you start using Riley, it doesn’t just log or respond to you, it safely remembers. From tracking to what’s worked in the past, Riley learns from you to offer relevant guidance.\\n\\nClarity without ignoring\\nyour individuality\\n\\nEvery family is different, Riley gets that! You'll receive clear, science-backed guidance that respects your individual parenting style and real-life context.\\n\\nGet Started For Free\"},{\"i\":7,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"Real Reviews, Real Families\\n\\nWhy Parents Love Riley\\n“10 days into having our newborn, we’ve already developed the habit of saying “Hm, not sure. Ask Riley” multiple times a day. Not sure what we’d do without having Riley to back our instincts.”\\nMax L., Dad of Baby R (1 mo)\\n“Riley offers calm and reassurance while Google makes me spiral. With my second, it feels like we’re starting over and have forgotten everything about the newborn phase but Riley’s here for all my questions”\\nMeg F., Mom of Baby A (5 mos) and Baby H (2 yrs)\\n“Compared to every other app, especially chat tools, Riley asks better questions and more relevant follow-ups based on my child’s age and the nuance of the moment - the end result is always more helpful.”\\nRebeckah R., Mom of Baby N. (7mo)\\n“Riley’s tracking and recommendations are smart and proactive. I love that it’s personalized and remembers details about my family without me having to myself.”\\nApp Store Review\\n“I was traveling this week and *terrifyingly* my pump broke and I was panicking. Riley pulled through. Having a resource to text with at 1 am? 11/10.”\\nR, Mom of Baby K. (5mo)\\nJoin the club\"},{\"i\":8,\"tag\":\"DIV\",\"text\":\"\\nParenting is hard. Riley makes it easier.\\nOne App for All Your Parenting Needs\\n24/7 Personalized Support\\n\\nReal-time, science-backed advice tailored to your baby's needs and your parenting style—available whenever you need it (even at 3am).\\n\\nSmart, Predictive Tracking\\n\\nRiley doesn't just store your data, it learns and grows with you. Track sleep, feed, diapers, development and more to stay on top of what's next for your baby.\\n\\nTips Tailored Just for You\\n\\nNo more endless Googling. Riley gives you helpful tips made just for your family—so you can parent with a little more ease (and a lot less guesswork).\\n\\nGet Started For Free\\n\\nDesigned with Real Parents in Mind\\n\\nWhy Riley Stands Out\\n\\nSee how Riley outshines other parenting tools with intelligent features and tailored advice. It’s the one-stop-shop for all your parenting needs!\\n\\nFeature/Benefit\\tRiley\\tGoogle Search\\tReddit\\tChatGPT\\tClaude\\tOther Tracking Apps\\tPodcasts, Books, & Blogs\\n24/7 Instant Answers\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\nExpert-Vetted, Science Backed Support\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\nGuidance Tailored to You & Your Family\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\nProactively Turns Tracking Into Tips\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\nAll-In-One Tracking & Support\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\n\\t\\nJoin Riley—early, easy, free\"},{\"i\":9,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"We’re Here to Make Things Clear\\nHow do I know I can trust Riley?\\nHow is Riley different from ChatGPT or other parenting apps?\\nWhat can’t I ask Riley?\\nAre you going to keep my kids’ data private?\\nDo I need to track everything for Riley to work?\"},{\"i\":10,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"Insightful Reads for Modern Parents\\nExplore the Riley Blog\\nDevelopment\\nFeeding\\nHealth\\nNews\\nPregnancy\\nSleep\\nBaby Witching Hour: What It Is, When and Why It Happens, and How to Manage It\\n1 Month Old Sleep Guide: Bedtime and Nap Schedules\\n16 Month Old Sleep Schedule: How Much Should a 16 Month Old Sleep?\\nExplore the blog\"},{\"i\":11,\"tag\":\"SECTION\",\"text\":\"We are raising a generation\\nof confident parents.\\nGet support that gets you\"},{\"i\":12,\"tag\":\"FOOTER\",\"text\":\"Stay in the loop with Riley's newsletter.\\n\\nSign up\\nBlog\\nPricing\\nEditorial Process\\nPrivacy Policy\\nTerms of Service\\nSupport\\n\\nGet the App\\n\\n© 2025 Riley\"},{\"i\":13,\"tag\":\"DIV\",\"text\":\"\"}],\"svgs\":[{\"sec